# Built pack zips
/dist/
*.zip

# Personal, never committed
CLAUDE.local.md

# Agent orchestration state — session-scoped and machine-local. A pattern rather than the
# bare directory because CLAUDE.md makes `.omc/skills/**` the one committable exception;
# `.omc/` alone would stop git descending and the negation could never fire.
.omc/*
!.omc/skills/
